description:
Extend Villa SDK with email linking and recovery methods.

## New Types (packages/sdk/src/types.ts)
```typescript
interface EmailVerification {
  verified: boolean
  domain?: string // 'gmail.com', 'outlook.com'
  method?: 'oauth_google' | 'oauth_microsoft' | 'zkemail'
  verifiedAt?: string
  onchainEnrolled?: boolean
}

type EmailVerificationResult = 
  | { success: true; domain: string }
  | { success: false; error: string; code: EmailErrorCode }
```

## New Methods (packages/sdk/src/simple.ts)
```typescript
interface VillaInstance {
  // ... existing ...

  // Link email to account (opens OAuth or zkEmail UI)
  linkEmail: () => Promise<EmailVerificationResult>

  // Check linked email status
  getEmailStatus: () => Promise<EmailVerification | null>

  // Recover account with email (lost passkey flow)
  recoverWithEmail: () => Promise<VillaUser>

  // Remove email link
  unlinkEmail: () => Promise<void>
}
```

## Bridge Messages
- VILLA_EMAIL_LINK_SUCCESS
- VILLA_EMAIL_RECOVERY_SUCCESS
- VILLA_EMAIL_ERROR
